<title>USA: Lawton Water, Okla., 1997, won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Lawton Water, Okla., 1997, won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $10 million of Lawton Water Authority, Okla., sales tax and utility system revenue bonds, series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.2965 percent.</p>
</text>
